1
00:00:18,393 --> 00:00:19,811
Where am I?

2
00:00:21,396 --> 00:00:22,689
Oh, it's nice.

3
00:00:24,983 --> 00:00:26,401
Hmm?

4
00:00:27,152 --> 00:00:28,153
What's that?

5
00:00:28,236 --> 00:00:29,112
Whoa!

6
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:33,575
What the...

7
00:00:34,534 --> 00:00:38,538
Saotome.

8
00:00:39,164 --> 00:00:40,040
Kuno!

9
00:00:40,123 --> 00:00:43,752
You're my love.

10
00:00:53,219 --> 00:00:57,474
RANMA1/2

11
00:02:19,681 --> 00:02:20,932
BECAUSE THERE'S SOMEONE HE LIKES

12
00:02:22,767 --> 00:02:24,853
Tendo, let's go today!

13
00:02:24,936 --> 00:02:27,147
Saotome, step away from her now!

14
00:02:27,730 --> 00:02:29,149
Ugh. Give me a break already.

15
00:02:30,483 --> 00:02:31,526
I hate men!

16
00:02:35,864 --> 00:02:37,073
Why is this here?

17
00:02:37,157 --> 00:02:38,158
It's a present.

18
00:02:39,075 --> 00:02:40,952
- No thanks.
- Hey!

19
00:02:41,828 --> 00:02:44,330
Who said it was for you, Nabiki Tendo?

20
00:02:45,456 --> 00:02:46,708
It's for the...

21
00:02:46,791 --> 00:02:48,835
Uh, for the...

22
00:02:48,918 --> 00:02:51,004
The adorable girl with the braid.

23
00:02:53,381 --> 00:02:55,341
I wasted my soy milk because of you.

24
00:02:55,425 --> 00:02:56,342
You narcissist.

25
00:02:57,927 --> 00:03:00,096
A set of five for 3,000 yen.

26
00:03:02,223 --> 00:03:04,142
This is my girl with the braid!

27
00:03:04,767 --> 00:03:07,812
Oh, her guard's all the way down.

28
00:03:07,896 --> 00:03:09,397
Kinda like a boy, right?

29
00:03:10,523 --> 00:03:12,066
It's not very respectable.

30
00:03:12,150 --> 00:03:14,360
You switched off Akane way too fast.

31
00:03:14,444 --> 00:03:15,695
Who said I switched off?

32
00:03:18,031 --> 00:03:19,407
You're not hoping to cheat on her?

33
00:03:19,490 --> 00:03:22,410
That's not very nice.

34
00:03:22,493 --> 00:03:24,537
Akane is pure and innocent.

35
00:03:25,205 --> 00:03:27,290
And the pigtailed girl's a sporty beauty.

36
00:03:28,249 --> 00:03:31,044
They're both so cute,
I simply can't let either of them go!

37
00:03:31,711 --> 00:03:36,049
So my heart is crying out for the chance
to date the both of them simultaneously!

38
00:03:36,132 --> 00:03:38,092
So in other words...

39
00:03:39,594 --> 00:03:41,512
you're wanting to two-time this girl!

40
00:03:41,596 --> 00:03:43,848
Set of five for 4,000.

41
00:03:43,932 --> 00:03:45,516
You heartless entrepreneur.

42
00:03:46,100 --> 00:03:47,769
- Deal!
- Cash, please.

43
00:03:48,603 --> 00:03:49,896
Hey, Ranma.

44
00:03:49,979 --> 00:03:51,814
Kuno wants to see you.

45
00:03:51,898 --> 00:03:54,234
Really? What does he want now?

46
00:03:55,193 --> 00:03:56,861
What is she up to?

47
00:03:57,445 --> 00:04:00,448
Wh-What the hell are you doing?

48
00:04:00,949 --> 00:04:02,700
That's what I want to know!

49
00:04:02,784 --> 00:04:04,494
If you wish to give her a gift,

50
00:04:04,577 --> 00:04:07,705
doing so through Ranma would be
the most expedited way.

51
00:04:07,789 --> 00:04:10,166
- No thanks.
- Whoa, careful with that!

52
00:04:10,667 --> 00:04:12,710
You should just forget
about that girl already.

53
00:04:12,794 --> 00:04:13,628
What?

54
00:04:13,711 --> 00:04:19,092
If I made a wild guess, I'd bet
you'll probably never see her again.

55
00:04:19,175 --> 00:04:21,552
Wait. No, hold on.

56
00:04:22,136 --> 00:04:23,471
What did you say?

57
00:04:23,554 --> 00:04:26,641
You should accept that the two of you
live in different worlds.

58
00:04:30,853 --> 00:04:33,147
Hey, man. What if someone was down there?

59
00:04:33,231 --> 00:04:35,525
Never see her again?

60
00:04:37,277 --> 00:04:39,445
What do you mean by that, Saotome?

61
00:04:41,155 --> 00:04:43,992
He's quick
when he's running away.

62
00:04:48,496 --> 00:04:49,622
Ouch! Uh-oh.

63
00:04:50,623 --> 00:04:52,417
Hmph. My pigtailed girl!

64
00:04:53,126 --> 00:04:55,295
I'm never letting go of you!

65
00:04:55,837 --> 00:04:59,424
- Apologies in advance for this, Ranma.
- That's hot!

66
00:04:59,507 --> 00:05:00,758
Ranma?

67
00:05:01,342 --> 00:05:02,927
Get your hands off me.

68
00:05:03,011 --> 00:05:05,930
Stop holding me, you idiot!

69
00:05:07,807 --> 00:05:10,476
Do you finally get it now? See you.

70
00:05:12,687 --> 00:05:14,022
Hold it!

71
00:05:14,105 --> 00:05:17,025
I will not be fooled
by some cheap party tricks!

72
00:05:17,108 --> 00:05:19,152
Huh? What? You don't get it.

73
00:05:19,652 --> 00:05:20,528
Huh.

74
00:05:21,529 --> 00:05:23,531
All right, listen carefully.

75
00:05:23,614 --> 00:05:25,408
The girl with the braid...

76
00:05:25,491 --> 00:05:30,496
Her body and soul...
...they all belong to Ranma!

77
00:05:30,580 --> 00:05:31,664
Hmm?

78
00:05:31,748 --> 00:05:33,791
You understand, don't you?

79
00:05:34,667 --> 00:05:35,501
Huh?

80
00:05:43,092 --> 00:05:45,470
- You are an enemy of women!
- Hey!

81
00:05:45,553 --> 00:05:47,013
You're getting the wrong idea.

82
00:05:47,096 --> 00:05:50,350
I will destroy you!
I'm using my power to save her!

83
00:05:51,559 --> 00:05:53,102
Oh, really?

84
00:05:53,853 --> 00:05:57,357
Okay then. If you lose this match,
you give up on the girl with the braid.

85
00:05:57,440 --> 00:05:58,608
Never!

86
00:06:02,070 --> 00:06:03,071
Huh?

87
00:06:04,572 --> 00:06:06,407
- Whoa!
- Gotcha!

88
00:06:09,869 --> 00:06:11,496
You can't get away.

89
00:06:15,249 --> 00:06:17,460
Whoa!

90
00:06:18,044 --> 00:06:19,337
Huh?

91
00:06:19,420 --> 00:06:20,630
Hi, Akane.

92
00:06:24,217 --> 00:06:25,593
Just for your information,

93
00:06:25,676 --> 00:06:28,179
Kuno can get brutal against men.

94
00:06:28,262 --> 00:06:30,973
All he needs to do is
get serious enough about it.

95
00:06:31,599 --> 00:06:33,893
Ooh. And just for your information,

96
00:06:34,811 --> 00:06:36,104
blue panties don't look good on you.

97
00:06:36,896 --> 00:06:38,606
Go die for all I care!

98
00:06:38,689 --> 00:06:41,109
- That's enough playtime.
- Hmm?

99
00:06:41,984 --> 00:06:44,195
Jab! Jab! Jab! Jab! Jab!

100
00:06:44,278 --> 00:06:46,197
Jab! Jab! Jab! Jab! Jab!

101
00:06:49,909 --> 00:06:51,911
Stay out of the way!

102
00:06:52,578 --> 00:06:53,579
Final blow!

103
00:06:53,663 --> 00:06:56,416
Idiot!
Keep your eyes on the fight.

104
00:06:57,041 --> 00:06:58,501
Hyah!

105
00:07:07,510 --> 00:07:09,512
What was all that? The kicks!

106
00:07:09,595 --> 00:07:10,888
Oh, well, uh...

107
00:07:12,056 --> 00:07:15,017
Wow! I think you hit
every one of his weak points.

108
00:07:15,101 --> 00:07:17,603
It turns out he was pretty easy to beat.

109
00:07:17,687 --> 00:07:20,481
Was he really though?
I'm fairly sure he got a blow in.

110
00:07:20,565 --> 00:07:23,484
Hmph. That little baby hit wasn't nothing.

111
00:07:23,568 --> 00:07:24,861
Are you sure you're okay?

112
00:07:24,944 --> 00:07:28,114
I barely remember it, 'cause it
doesn't hurt--

113
00:07:28,197 --> 00:07:31,993
Huh? Don't pretend it doesn't hurt
when it literally makes you cry.

114
00:07:32,577 --> 00:07:35,830
I knew it. You seemed distracted
in the fight earlier.

115
00:07:35,913 --> 00:07:38,124
Huh?

116
00:07:38,791 --> 00:07:41,169
Wait. Wh... What the heck are these?

117
00:07:41,252 --> 00:07:42,670
You should ask Kuno, not me.

118
00:07:42,753 --> 00:07:45,798
He bought them off of me.
I wanted a little extra cash.

119
00:07:45,882 --> 00:07:47,008
You what?

120
00:07:47,091 --> 00:07:50,887
Ha! All these pictures are so
boring anyway, who would even want them?

121
00:07:51,888 --> 00:07:55,725
If we compare the two of us, you don't
even have half the sex appeal that I do.

122
00:07:56,976 --> 00:07:57,810
Hmm?

123
00:07:57,894 --> 00:07:58,936
OSTEOPATHIC CLINIC -
CHIROPRACTOR

124
00:07:59,020 --> 00:07:59,896
ACUPUNCTURE - ACUPRESSURE

125
00:07:59,979 --> 00:08:02,482
Hmm. You're in bad shape.

126
00:08:02,565 --> 00:08:04,901
Aside from this nasty bokuto strike,

127
00:08:05,485 --> 00:08:08,321
you also have severe contusions
and dislocations.

128
00:08:09,363 --> 00:08:10,990
Who was it that did this?

129
00:08:11,073 --> 00:08:12,617
Well, uh...

130
00:08:12,700 --> 00:08:13,743
It was...

131
00:08:14,994 --> 00:08:15,953
Hmm?

132
00:08:16,037 --> 00:08:17,997
A girl who suffers from
no sex appea--

133
00:08:18,080 --> 00:08:19,707
Oh, I'm so sorry!

134
00:08:23,002 --> 00:08:24,504
Was this your doing, Akane?

135
00:08:24,587 --> 00:08:26,839
Uh, maybe, but it's because...

136
00:08:26,923 --> 00:08:30,092
Pfft. Yeah, now you're doing
the cute girl act.

137
00:08:30,176 --> 00:08:31,302
Mmm.

138
00:08:31,385 --> 00:08:34,597
I knew it.
It was obvious it was you right away.

139
00:08:36,766 --> 00:08:39,143
The way you dislocated
this joint in particular.

140
00:08:39,227 --> 00:08:41,854
So interesting to see
your signature move this way.

141
00:08:41,938 --> 00:08:42,939
Really?

142
00:08:44,148 --> 00:08:45,983
So, you're Ranma, right?

143
00:08:47,610 --> 00:08:50,112
I heard you were chosen
to be Akane's fiancé.

144
00:08:50,196 --> 00:08:52,448
Our parents made that decision
on their own.

145
00:08:52,532 --> 00:08:54,700
Yes, it's a bit early for all that.

146
00:08:54,784 --> 00:08:56,869
The two of you are still kids.

147
00:08:56,953 --> 00:08:58,579
I guess so.

148
00:08:59,372 --> 00:09:01,082
So I'm still a kid.

149
00:09:02,333 --> 00:09:03,876
Stop! That hurts.

150
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:06,587
Oh! Well that's strange.
Where are you still hurting?

151
00:09:06,671 --> 00:09:08,506
What? Oh, uh...

152
00:09:08,589 --> 00:09:10,424
Huh? Hey.

153
00:09:11,050 --> 00:09:13,219
- Dr. Tofu is very good at his job.
- Hmm.

154
00:09:15,846 --> 00:09:17,473
- Oh, Ranma, can we talk?
- Hmm?

155
00:09:17,557 --> 00:09:18,808
Yeah?

156
00:09:18,891 --> 00:09:22,728
Regardless of your betrothal,
do try and get along with Akane.

157
00:09:23,980 --> 00:09:26,732
It's not like I go out of my way
to pick a fight with her.

158
00:09:27,358 --> 00:09:29,735
She's the one who keeps picking on me.

159
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:33,030
But still. She's a real sweet girl.

160
00:09:33,114 --> 00:09:34,448
Is she?

161
00:09:37,868 --> 00:09:39,453
You'll understand one day.

162
00:09:40,538 --> 00:09:42,373
What were you two talking about?

163
00:09:42,456 --> 00:09:43,541
Ah, nothing.

164
00:09:43,624 --> 00:09:45,918
Only that you're a lot to handle
'cause you're such a tomboy.

165
00:09:47,211 --> 00:09:48,546
Huh. Coming at me?

166
00:09:49,672 --> 00:09:50,840
- I see.
- Huh?

167
00:09:51,340 --> 00:09:52,508
Hmm?

168
00:09:57,263 --> 00:09:58,264
Hmm?

169
00:09:58,889 --> 00:10:00,224
Hmm? Hmm?

170
00:10:01,434 --> 00:10:03,185
I was just kidding.

171
00:10:03,269 --> 00:10:05,146
Getting all girlie and heartbroken now.

172
00:10:05,938 --> 00:10:07,231
What are you trying to say?

173
00:10:07,315 --> 00:10:08,691
There you are.

174
00:10:08,774 --> 00:10:11,402
I almost didn't recognize you
without you getting mad at me.

175
00:10:11,485 --> 00:10:13,279
- What did you say?
- Whoa.

176
00:10:13,362 --> 00:10:15,865
- Get back here.
- Too slow!

177
00:10:15,948 --> 00:10:20,077
Four, three, two, one.

178
00:10:20,161 --> 00:10:21,162
Whoa.

179
00:10:23,039 --> 00:10:24,248
What's the matter with you?

180
00:10:24,332 --> 00:10:25,791
My legs. Oh.

181
00:10:26,417 --> 00:10:31,422
Ugh, that jerk. He must've done something
when he patted my back earlier.

182
00:10:33,424 --> 00:10:36,260
All right. Guess I don't have a choice.

183
00:10:36,344 --> 00:10:38,012
Uh, wait. What are you doing?

184
00:10:38,095 --> 00:10:39,972
Piggyback. You can't walk, can you?

185
00:10:40,056 --> 00:10:41,974
I... No way!

186
00:10:42,058 --> 00:10:43,851
That's so embarrassing for a man to...

187
00:10:43,934 --> 00:10:44,977
That's cold!

188
00:10:46,646 --> 00:10:48,481
It shouldn't be a problem
if we're both girls.

189
00:10:51,901 --> 00:10:53,444
I'm not too heavy, am I?

190
00:10:53,527 --> 00:10:55,988
Stop worrying about it.
You can't even stand up.

191
00:10:57,239 --> 00:11:00,576
- She's a real sweet girl.
- I guess she can be.

192
00:11:01,452 --> 00:11:02,912
You'll understand one day.

193
00:11:02,995 --> 00:11:04,664
Nope, still not getting it.

194
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:09,794
ANYTHING GOES MARTIAL ARTS
TENDO DOJO

195
00:11:13,297 --> 00:11:17,927
Mr. Saotome, and Ranma too.
Your breakfast is ready now.

196
00:11:18,010 --> 00:11:19,011
Oh.

197
00:11:19,095 --> 00:11:21,931
- Thanks for telling us, Kasumi.
- No, no, no. Whoa!

198
00:11:23,182 --> 00:11:25,559
STARTING TODAY, I HAVE
A PART-TIME JOB. - GENMA SAOTOME

199
00:11:25,643 --> 00:11:28,604
You got a job? You planning on working
part-time in a zoo?

200
00:11:28,688 --> 00:11:29,522
'Cause, uh...

201
00:11:29,605 --> 00:11:30,439
WRONG!

202
00:11:30,523 --> 00:11:32,149
Could you pass the soy sauce?

203
00:11:32,233 --> 00:11:34,985
Morning training, huh? Well, good for you.

204
00:11:35,069 --> 00:11:36,362
Good morning.

205
00:11:38,155 --> 00:11:39,156
Dang, it's hot!

206
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:42,868
Come on now, Ranma.
Are you missing any sense of modesty?

207
00:11:47,957 --> 00:11:50,459
Oh, to hell with all that. Screw modesty.

208
00:11:50,543 --> 00:11:51,877
You have no shame.

209
00:11:52,378 --> 00:11:55,047
Like a tomboy has any right
to try and shame me.

210
00:11:55,548 --> 00:11:56,632
Before I forget,

211
00:11:56,716 --> 00:11:59,635
could you two stop by Dr. Tofu's office
on your way back?

212
00:12:00,636 --> 00:12:03,848
If it's okay, I'd like you
to return the book I borrowed.

213
00:12:03,931 --> 00:12:06,934
You can't do it yourself?

214
00:12:07,017 --> 00:12:08,936
I'm a little too busy today.

215
00:12:09,019 --> 00:12:11,564
Oh, okay.
Yeah, I guess I can go do it.

216
00:12:12,064 --> 00:12:14,275
But that would be the perfect excuse--

217
00:12:14,358 --> 00:12:15,526
We'll be late.

218
00:12:16,026 --> 00:12:18,738
No!

219
00:12:22,241 --> 00:12:24,660
- A-Akane, wait just a second!
- Shut up!

220
00:12:27,371 --> 00:12:29,707
Ranma, you need to keep
that big mouth shut!

221
00:12:29,790 --> 00:12:31,751
Come on now. What's that supposed to mean?

222
00:12:31,834 --> 00:12:34,378
I was clear.
Keep that big mouth of yours shut.

223
00:12:35,129 --> 00:12:35,963
Uh...

224
00:12:36,046 --> 00:12:37,089
Uh...

225
00:12:37,173 --> 00:12:38,966
This is why I was telling you to wait.

226
00:12:39,049 --> 00:12:40,593
I didn't realize.

227
00:12:41,969 --> 00:12:44,513
What the hell are you all doing?
Wanting a free show?

228
00:12:44,597 --> 00:12:45,806
Who wants to go first?

229
00:12:47,099 --> 00:12:49,018
Akane Tendo.

230
00:12:54,231 --> 00:12:56,192
We will no longer challenge you to fight.

231
00:12:56,275 --> 00:12:57,193
Wha...

232
00:12:58,277 --> 00:12:59,945
We all agreed.

233
00:13:00,029 --> 00:13:03,199
We decided to accept the fact
that you're engaged now.

234
00:13:03,282 --> 00:13:04,241
Huh?

235
00:13:04,325 --> 00:13:06,035
That's what this is about?

236
00:13:06,118 --> 00:13:07,203
But why now?

237
00:13:07,828 --> 00:13:11,665
Well, rumor has it
that Ranma Saotome defeated me.

238
00:13:12,249 --> 00:13:14,251
Which is such an absurd falsehood.

239
00:13:15,669 --> 00:13:18,422
However, I refuse to be defeated!

240
00:13:19,340 --> 00:13:22,760
Kuno was the strongest person left
at Furinkan High School.

241
00:13:22,843 --> 00:13:25,012
But he was also
the biggest pervert of us all.

242
00:13:25,095 --> 00:13:26,555
What on earth did you just call me?

243
00:13:27,681 --> 00:13:28,808
I won't give up.

244
00:13:29,433 --> 00:13:31,477
I'll battle any coward like Ranma.

245
00:13:31,977 --> 00:13:35,815
They can kick me a hundred times over.
I refuse to process the pain.

246
00:13:35,898 --> 00:13:38,692
Who do you think you're calling
a coward?

247
00:13:38,776 --> 00:13:39,693
Hmm?

248
00:13:39,777 --> 00:13:42,196
You don't have to be
such a sore loser, you know.

249
00:13:42,279 --> 00:13:43,447
Whoa!

250
00:13:46,450 --> 00:13:49,203
My little lady with the braid is
finally here.

251
00:13:50,496 --> 00:13:53,123
Seriously, you need to remember
what gender you are.

252
00:13:54,542 --> 00:13:55,709
I've missed you so.

253
00:13:55,793 --> 00:13:57,461
But wait a sec.

254
00:13:57,545 --> 00:13:59,380
I thought Akane was the one you liked.

255
00:13:59,463 --> 00:14:00,714
Of course I do.

256
00:14:00,798 --> 00:14:02,132
She's watching, you know.

257
00:14:02,800 --> 00:14:05,427
- Hmm?
- How did I not realize, Kuno?

258
00:14:06,136 --> 00:14:09,723
If you like her more,
then I'll happily step aside.

259
00:14:09,807 --> 00:14:10,683
Oh.

260
00:14:10,766 --> 00:14:12,059
Akane Tendo!

261
00:14:12,142 --> 00:14:13,227
What are you talking about?

262
00:14:13,310 --> 00:14:15,771
Her offer to step aside is
so endearing.

263
00:14:16,438 --> 00:14:18,816
And she's so adorable, I can't let go.

264
00:14:19,441 --> 00:14:20,860
I love both of you!

265
00:14:30,870 --> 00:14:32,663
Whoa!

266
00:14:33,330 --> 00:14:34,915
That was great, Saotome.

267
00:14:34,999 --> 00:14:38,711
Well, yeah. Didn't he study acrobatics
or something when he went to China?

268
00:14:38,794 --> 00:14:39,795
It was kempo.

269
00:14:40,421 --> 00:14:43,299
By the way, how far have you gotten
with Akane?

270
00:14:43,382 --> 00:14:44,258
Hmm?

271
00:14:44,341 --> 00:14:46,760
Come on, we know she's your fiancée.
Don't play dumb.

272
00:14:46,844 --> 00:14:47,678
Huh?

273
00:14:47,761 --> 00:14:50,973
So you guys must be doing
some pretty freaky stuff, am I right?

274
00:14:51,056 --> 00:14:52,182
No. Nothing.

275
00:14:52,266 --> 00:14:54,685
You liar. I'm betting
you two are crazy dirty.

276
00:14:54,768 --> 00:14:57,479
How much insane sex do you do
every day, bro?

277
00:14:57,563 --> 00:14:58,689
We don't do anything!

278
00:14:59,732 --> 00:15:01,150
Get it, Akane!

279
00:15:01,233 --> 00:15:02,318
Yeah!

280
00:15:03,569 --> 00:15:04,570
Way to go!

281
00:15:04,653 --> 00:15:06,405
All right. Now it's our turn.

282
00:15:12,620 --> 00:15:14,622
- Damn. Look at how cute she is.
- Huh?

283
00:15:15,164 --> 00:15:17,166
That girl is in no way cute.

284
00:15:17,249 --> 00:15:19,543
Besides, she has a crush
on someone else anyway.

285
00:15:19,627 --> 00:15:20,878
Yeah?

286
00:15:23,464 --> 00:15:24,798
Hey, Saotome.

287
00:15:24,882 --> 00:15:27,384
Aren't you supposed to be a kempo expert?

288
00:15:27,468 --> 00:15:28,552
Mm-hmm.

289
00:15:28,636 --> 00:15:31,722
I guess kempo doesn't do
too much blocking or dodging.

290
00:15:32,264 --> 00:15:34,516
I was a little distracted.

291
00:15:35,184 --> 00:15:37,478
I'm sorry. Does it still hurt?

292
00:15:38,687 --> 00:15:41,523
Hey, I've apologized to you,
like, 30 times now.

293
00:15:41,607 --> 00:15:42,733
Hmm?

294
00:15:42,816 --> 00:15:43,734
Oh, hey.

295
00:15:44,401 --> 00:15:46,779
Old Man?
What are you doing here in the street?

296
00:15:48,155 --> 00:15:51,325
Really?
So my new hire is your father?

297
00:15:51,408 --> 00:15:53,118
You two don't look much alike.

298
00:15:53,202 --> 00:15:55,537
By the way, what happened to your face?

299
00:15:55,621 --> 00:15:57,164
Accident in P.E. class.

300
00:15:58,332 --> 00:16:01,460
I have an ointment that will work wonders
on that. Just one second.

301
00:16:10,260 --> 00:16:11,387
Hmm?

302
00:16:11,470 --> 00:16:13,138
AAARGH! PANDAS CAN'T TALK!

303
00:16:13,222 --> 00:16:14,890
So why did you pick up the phone?

304
00:16:15,557 --> 00:16:17,643
Hello? How can I help you today?

305
00:16:18,644 --> 00:16:19,687
Uh...

306
00:16:20,354 --> 00:16:22,731
Sure. Understood. 'Kay, bye.

307
00:16:23,232 --> 00:16:24,650
I'm gonna head home.

308
00:16:25,776 --> 00:16:27,486
Did something end up happening?

309
00:16:27,569 --> 00:16:28,904
No, not really.

310
00:16:28,988 --> 00:16:31,156
Great. Why you heading off in such a rush?

311
00:16:31,240 --> 00:16:33,117
I mean, you like the doctor. Hmm?

312
00:16:35,452 --> 00:16:36,578
Stop it.

313
00:16:36,662 --> 00:16:38,831
There's already another person
that he likes, okay?

314
00:16:41,250 --> 00:16:42,584
That was her on the phone.

315
00:16:43,252 --> 00:16:44,837
She said she'll be coming over soon.

316
00:16:46,630 --> 00:16:49,133
Hello? Good afternoon.

317
00:16:49,758 --> 00:16:52,094
Whoa! She's the one he has a crush on?

318
00:16:52,177 --> 00:16:53,846
He's got a type.

319
00:16:53,929 --> 00:16:55,097
Not her!

320
00:16:55,889 --> 00:16:57,933
You're leaving already, Kasumi?

321
00:16:58,017 --> 00:17:00,102
Just heading to the chiropractor.

322
00:17:00,185 --> 00:17:01,520
Kasumi?

323
00:17:02,980 --> 00:17:05,899
Dr. Tofu has a crush on Kasumi.

324
00:17:06,900 --> 00:17:08,610
It's obvious from the way he acts.

325
00:17:12,906 --> 00:17:14,700
Hey, you two. What are you doing out here?

326
00:17:14,783 --> 00:17:16,618
Uh, n-nothing at all.

327
00:17:17,161 --> 00:17:18,537
R-Right?

328
00:17:22,458 --> 00:17:23,959
So much for heading out.

329
00:17:24,043 --> 00:17:26,670
Now, let's see the damage.

330
00:17:27,504 --> 00:17:29,631
Oh. A mark from a ball.

331
00:17:29,715 --> 00:17:31,842
Akane must have hit this one, right?

332
00:17:33,761 --> 00:17:37,514
The depth and angle of the stitches were
what ultimately gave it away.

333
00:17:37,598 --> 00:17:40,601
Wow. So you can tell
how feral she is just from that?

334
00:17:40,684 --> 00:17:44,063
Come on! You weren't paying attention
so this is your fault.

335
00:17:44,146 --> 00:17:45,230
- Oh.
- Ah.

336
00:17:46,356 --> 00:17:49,693
Sorry. I was just joking around.

337
00:17:50,652 --> 00:17:51,653
Uh...

338
00:17:52,279 --> 00:17:53,113
Dummy.

339
00:17:53,197 --> 00:17:56,658
There's nothing wrong with it.
You know? It's good to stay active.

340
00:17:56,742 --> 00:17:59,161
- But, still...
- It's good that you're so healthy.

341
00:17:59,244 --> 00:18:00,579
Not sexy though.

342
00:18:02,706 --> 00:18:04,333
Good afternoon.

343
00:18:04,416 --> 00:18:06,043
Oh, Kasumi.

344
00:18:07,878 --> 00:18:09,088
Uh...

345
00:18:09,171 --> 00:18:10,297
Hello?

346
00:18:10,380 --> 00:18:12,257
Did I hear a wet snap just now?

347
00:18:12,925 --> 00:18:14,635
Hey, Kasumi.

348
00:18:14,718 --> 00:18:17,387
Oh. Hi, Ranma. What's wrong?

349
00:18:17,471 --> 00:18:20,390
Nothing wrong.
He started coming in recently.

350
00:18:20,474 --> 00:18:22,226
Right, Ranma?

351
00:18:22,309 --> 00:18:23,268
I SAID I'M RANMA'S POP!

352
00:18:23,352 --> 00:18:24,353
Hey, Doc?

353
00:18:24,978 --> 00:18:26,396
So, how can I help you?

354
00:18:26,480 --> 00:18:29,399
Oh, yes.
Bringing back the book I borrowed.

355
00:18:29,483 --> 00:18:30,484
Hey, Doc?

356
00:18:30,567 --> 00:18:32,861
Also, I wasn't sure if you wanted these.

357
00:18:33,612 --> 00:18:35,239
Oh, thank you.

358
00:18:35,322 --> 00:18:36,865
It's a mask, isn't it?

359
00:18:36,949 --> 00:18:38,909
No, that wasn't the gift.

360
00:18:39,493 --> 00:18:42,412
- Dr. Tofu.
- This is great.

361
00:18:42,496 --> 00:18:45,249
- I'm stuck.
- Actually, that's the plate.

362
00:18:45,791 --> 00:18:47,209
Doctor!

363
00:18:47,292 --> 00:18:49,837
Hmm. Uh, something I can help you with?

364
00:18:49,920 --> 00:18:51,130
My neck hurts!

365
00:18:51,213 --> 00:18:53,715
Another injury? All right then.

366
00:18:53,799 --> 00:18:54,800
Are you serious?

367
00:18:54,883 --> 00:18:57,219
Sit, sit.
I can fix that right up actually.

368
00:18:57,302 --> 00:18:58,637
Here.

369
00:18:58,720 --> 00:19:02,349
I'm sorry, Mr. Saotome,
would you mind getting Kasumi some tea?

370
00:19:02,432 --> 00:19:03,308
HEY! OVER HERE!

371
00:19:04,476 --> 00:19:07,646
Dr. Tofu is always so funny to watch,
wouldn't you say?

372
00:19:08,147 --> 00:19:09,231
Oh, you think?

373
00:19:09,857 --> 00:19:12,943
He never acts like this
whenever you're not around, big sister.

374
00:19:13,026 --> 00:19:14,111
Oh?

375
00:19:25,914 --> 00:19:28,458
What's she doing? Is she crying?

376
00:19:34,006 --> 00:19:35,507
I don't like feeling this way.

377
00:19:36,758 --> 00:19:37,759
Oh!

378
00:19:39,303 --> 00:19:41,138
Ow!

379
00:19:42,598 --> 00:19:44,641
Well, I guess that proves you're fine.

380
00:19:46,894 --> 00:19:49,897
Please don't tell me that was
your crappy attempt at cheering me up.

381
00:19:49,980 --> 00:19:51,607
Oopsy-daisy.

382
00:19:51,690 --> 00:19:53,233
What's that supposed to mean?

383
00:19:53,317 --> 00:19:54,568
- Of course I was.
- Hmm?

384
00:19:56,486 --> 00:19:57,863
Oh, my neck is fixed.

385
00:20:00,949 --> 00:20:03,035
Okay. Wanna keep me company?

386
00:20:03,118 --> 00:20:04,119
Hmm?

387
00:20:08,916 --> 00:20:10,250
Come on. Take a swing!

388
00:20:10,334 --> 00:20:11,335
I don't know...

389
00:20:11,418 --> 00:20:13,378
Here I come!

390
00:20:16,215 --> 00:20:17,382
Whoa!

391
00:20:17,466 --> 00:20:20,552
I'm trying to blow off some steam here,
so stop playing and let's go!

392
00:20:22,596 --> 00:20:26,475
Come on, now. Doesn't it get tiring
being this angry all the time?

393
00:20:26,558 --> 00:20:28,977
You don't need to worry about that.

394
00:20:31,313 --> 00:20:32,648
You know what I was thinking?

395
00:20:33,649 --> 00:20:35,359
You're really cute when you smile.

396
00:20:35,943 --> 00:20:37,110
Huh?

397
00:20:39,529 --> 00:20:40,906
Gotcha.

398
00:20:45,369 --> 00:20:47,746
No fair! That one doesn't count.

399
00:20:47,829 --> 00:20:49,539
Let's go again!

400
00:21:02,010 --> 00:21:04,054
You're really cute when you smile.

401
00:21:05,055 --> 00:21:06,431
Did he mean that?

402
00:21:16,525 --> 00:21:18,527
What's with this face you got going on?

403
00:21:18,610 --> 00:21:20,112
That's a creepy smirk.

404
00:21:25,575 --> 00:21:28,203
So, your neck still hasn't healed yet?

405
00:21:28,287 --> 00:21:29,955
It was healed for, like, a minute.

406
00:21:30,038 --> 00:21:31,957
CHIROPRACTIC
